{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112233","id":2965306053,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wvvrF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112233/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112233/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aee211bcfa2096364eb2f015a4b0d4dcf73b7ab4","number":112233,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Modern Style: Use a style box for Input Map actions","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Addresses [one of the complains about the new style](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111118#issuecomment-3463630628). One which I couldn't disagree.\r\n\r\nThe new style makes the Input Map editor too flat. I modified it so it at least highlights the actions.\r\n\r\nThis is done by using `TreeItem::CELL_MODE_CUSTOM` alongside a callback that draws a StyleBox, which I named `style_highlight_subsection`. The Deadzone column uses `TreeItem::CELL_MODE_RANGE`, meaning it can't be applied to them, unfortunately.\r\n\r\nI avoided picking a color too bright as it would make the contrast between the text and the background too low, so it's just a tiny increase to work as a separator.\r\n\r\nThe StyleBox is fully transparent in the Classic theme, therefore it should not be affected.\r\n\r\n### Dark theme\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| ![before_dark](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66afb4f0-2c83-45ad-bd6b-27268508c261) | ![after_dark](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7e2c7c2-e6a9-4f0a-b733-3ee4f609fcc5) |\r\n\r\n\r\n### Light theme\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| ![before_light](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db7bf0e5-b549-44d1-94c9-47adec420ebe) | ![after_light](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f060c06-e8c0-4450-b5ca-bef52620006f) |\r\n\r\nClassic style for reference:\r\n![old](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5091dccd-d41a-42fb-b38c-3a065e26220f)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/